"end": 95971, "text": "Now the brother shall betray the brother to death, and the father the son; and children shall rise up against their parents, and shall cause them to be put to death.", "words": [[0, 86572], [4, 87032], [8, 87272], [16, 87552], [22, 87852], [29, 88232], [33, 88472], [41, 88732], [44, 88972], [51, 89632], [55, 89892], [59, 90032], [66, 90352], [70, 90612], [75, 91385], [79, 91531], [88, 91911], [94, 92231], [99, 92571], [102, 92831], [110, 93091], [116, 93331], [125, 93791], [129, 94271], [135, 94451], [141, 94811], [146, 95051], [149, 95191], [152, 95331], [156, 95511], [159, 95671]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 96321, "end": 102962, "text": "And you shall be hated of all men for my name’s sake: but he that shall endure to the end, the same shall be saved.", "words": [[0, 96321], [4, 96426], [8, 96546], [14, 96706], [17, 96846], [23, 97146], [26, 97346], [30, 97566], [34, 97846], [38, 98046], [41, 98246], [48, 98646], [54, 99255], [58, 99377], [61, 99617], [66, 99837], [72, 100077], [79, 100457], [82, 100697], [86, 100817], [91, 101437], [95, 101617], [100, 101917], [106, 102177], [109, 102337]]}, {"verse": 14, "start": 103312, "end": 115166, "text": "¶ But when you shall see the abomination of desolation, spoken of by Daniel the prophet, standing where it ought not, (let him that reads understand,) then let them that be in Judæa flee to the mountains:", "words": [[2, 103312], [6, 103413], [11, 103553], [15, 103713], [21, 103913], [25, 104113], [29, 104273], [41, 104773], [44, 105073], [56, 106073], [63, 106453], [66, 106713], [69, 106913], [76, 107273], [80, 107453], [89, 108133], [98, 108493], [104, 108813], [107, 108973], [113, 109113], [118, 109816], [123, 109995], [127, 110215], [132, 110505], [138, 110795], [151, 111795], [156, 112215], [160, 112435], [165, 112655], [170, 112855], [173, 113115], [176, 113515], [182, 113915], [187, 114175], [190, 114435], [194, 114555]]}, {"verse": 15, "start": 115516, "end": 121899, "text": "And let him that is on the housetop not go down into the house, neither enter in it, to take any thing out of his house:", "words": [[0, 115516], [4, 115680], [8, 115860], [12, 116080], [17, 116320], [20, 116460], [23, 116620], [27, 116720], [36, 117240], [40, 117400], [43, 117640], [48, 117900], [53, 118100], [57, 118260], [64, 118980], [72, 119220], [78, 119580], [81, 119800], [85, 119960], [88, 120280], [93, 120460], [97, 120640], [103, 120820], [107, 121120], [110, 121240], [114, 121340]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 122249, "end": 126151, "text": "And let him that is in the field not turn back again to take up his garment.", "words": [[0, 122249], [4, 122373], [8, 122573], [12, 122813], [17, 123073], [20, 123233], [23, 123373], [27, 123473], [33, 123793], [37, 124013], [42, 124313], [47, 124513], [53, 124893], [56, 125073], [61, 125293], [64, 125473], [68, 125613]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 126501, "end": 130620, "text": "But woe to them that are with child, and to them that give suck in those days!", "words": [[0, 126501], [4, 126642], [8, 126982], [11, 127082], [16, 127302], [21, 127522], [25, 127622], [30, 127782], [37, 128182], [41, 128662], [44, 128802], [49, 129002], [54, 129182], [59, 129402], [64, 129682], [67, 129862], [73, 130042]]}, {"verse": 18, "start": 130970, "end": 133271, "text": "And pray that your flight be not in the winter.", "words": [[0, 130970], [4, 131088], [9, 131388], [14, 131628], [19, 131768], [26, 132068], [29, 132288], [33, 132528], [36, 132688], [40, 132768]]}, {"verse": 19, "start": 133621, "end": 141805, "text": "For in those days shall be affliction, such as was not from the beginning of the creation which God created to this time, neither shall be.", "words": [[0, 133621], [4, 133730], [7, 133890], [13, 134130], [18, 134530], [24, 134910], [27, 135110], [39, 135990], [44, 136250], [47, 136550], [51, 136770], [55, 137070], [60, 137310], [64, 137430], [74, 137750], [77, 137970], [81, 138090], [90, 138510], [96, 138830], [100, 139110], [108, 139550], [111, 139770], [116, 139990], [122, 140750], [130, 140990], [136, 141370]]}, {"verse": 20, "start": 142155, "end": 149398, "text": "And except that the Lord had shortened those days, no flesh should be saved: but for the elect’s sake, whom he has chosen, he has shortened the days.", "words": [[0, 142155], [4, 142344], [11, 142574], [16, 142774], [20, 142914], [25, 143114], [29, 143274], [39, 143574], [45, 143834], [51, 144454], [54, 144674], [60, 144954], [67, 145194], [70, 145314], [77, 146097], [81, 146181], [85, 146301], [89, 146381], [97, 146741], [103, 147181], [108, 147321], [111, 147481], [115, 147601], [123, 148361], [126, 148421], [130, 148521], [140, 148741], [144, 148901]]}, {"verse": 21, "start": 149748, "end": 156364, "text": "And then if any man shall say to you, Lo, here is Christ; or, lo, he is there; believe him not:", "words": [[0, 149748], [4, 149888], [9, 150248], [12, 150328], [16, 150508], [20, 150728], [26, 150948], [30, 151188], [33, 151308], [38, 151788], [42, 152268], [47, 152428], [50, 152568], [58, 153419], [62, 153809], [66, 154239], [69, 154599], [72, 154779], [79, 155456], [87, 155658], [91, 155878]]}, {"verse": 22, "start": 156714, "end": 164781, "text": "For false Christs and false prophets shall rise, and shall show signs and wonders, to seduce, if it were possible, even the elect.", "words": [[0, 156714], [4, 156823], [10, 157323], [18, 157823], [22, 157983], [28, 158303], [37, 158803], [43, 159103], [49, 159843], [53, 160063], [59, 160283], [64, 160503], [70, 160923], [74, 161163], [83, 161503], [86, 161943], [94, 162763], [97, 162903], [100, 163003], [105, 163123], [115, 163903], [120, 164083], [124, 164263]]}, {"verse": 23, "start": 165131, "end": 168898, "text": "But take heed: behold, I have foretold you all things.", "words": [[0, 165131], [4, 165280], [9, 165500], [15, 166292], [23, 167095], [25, 167215], [30, 167335], [39, 167855], [43, 167975], [47, 168235]]}, {"verse": 24, "start": 169248, "end": 175654, "text": "¶ But in those days, after that tribulation, the sun shall be darkened, and the moon shall not give her light,", "words": [[2, 169248], [6, 169369], [9, 169509], [15, 169729], [21, 170449], [27, 170769], [32, 171009], [45, 172129], [49, 172289], [53, 172569], [59, 172849], [62, 172969], [72, 173769], [76, 173929], [80, 174029], [85, 174269], [91, 174549], [95, 174789], [100, 175009], [104, 175169]]}, {"verse": 25, "start": 176004, "end": 180854, "text": "And the stars of heaven shall fall, and the powers that are in heaven shall be shaken.", "words": [[0, 176004], [4, 176141], [8, 176261], [14, 176601], [17, 176881], [24, 177181], [30, 177521], [36, 178181], [40, 178501], [44, 178621], [51, 178981], [56, 179241], [60, 179381], [63, 179541], [70, 179801], [76, 180141], [79, 180301]]}, {"verse": 26, "start": 181204, "end": 186913, "text": "And then shall they see the Son of man coming in the clouds with great power and glory.", "words": [[0, 181204], [4, 181382], [9, 181662], [15, 181962], [20, 182162], [24, 182402], [28, 182582], [32, 182882], [35, 183022], [39, 183362], [46, 183762], [49, 184002], [53, 184122], [60, 184602], [65, 184882], [71, 185182], [77, 185662], [81, 186002]]}, {"verse": 27, "start": 187263, "end": 195914, "text": "And then shall he send his angels, and shall gather together his elect from the four winds, from the uttermost part of the earth to the uttermost part of heaven.", "words": [[0, 187263], [4, 187429], [9, 187709], [15, 188029], [18, 188189], [23, 188489], [27, 188649], [35, 189489], [39, 189669], [45, 189849], [52, 190209], [61, 190629], [65, 190849], [71, 191209], [76, 191429], [80, 191569], [85, 191849], [92, 192649], [97, 192809], [101, 192949], [111, 193389], [116, 193649], [119, 193769], [123, 193889], [129, 194329], [132, 194469], [136, 194589], [146, 195049], [151, 195329], [154, 195429]]}, {"verse": 28, "start": 196264, "end": 203344, "text": "Now learn a parable of the fig tree; When her branch is yet tender, and puts forth leaves, you know that summer is near:", "words": [[0, 196264], [4, 196550], [10, 196930], [12, 197050], [20, 197510], [23, 197710], [27, 197810], [31, 198030], [37, 198624], [42, 198740], [46, 198860], [53, 199180], [56, 199400], [60, 199560], [68, 199940], [72, 200360], [77, 200600], [83, 200860], [91, 201780], [95, 201940], [100, 202160], [105, 202360], [112, 202680], [115, 202920]]}, {"verse": 29, "start": 203694, "end": 210503, "text": "So you in like manner, when you shall see these things come to pass, know that it is near, even at the doors.", "words": [[0, 203694], [3, 203890], [7, 204310], [10, 204490], [15, 204710], [23, 205670], [28, 205790], [32, 205930], [38, 206110], [42, 206370], [48, 206590], [55, 206890], [60, 207150], [63, 207310], [69, 208090], [74, 208310], [79, 208550], [82, 208650], [85, 208790], [91, 209390], [96, 209630], [99, 209810], [103, 209930]]}, {"verse": 30, "start": 210853, "end": 216180, "text": "Assuredly I say to you, that this generation shall not pass, till all these things be done.", "words": [[0, 210853], [10, 211417], [12, 211537], [16, 211737], [19, 211917], [24, 212437], [29, 212677], [34, 212877], [45, 213417], [51, 213717], [55, 213937], [61, 214387], [66, 214837], [70, 215117], [76, 215297], [83, 215557], [86, 215737]]}, {"verse": 31, "start": 216530, "end": 220386, "text": "Heaven and earth shall pass away: but my words shall not pass away.", "words": [[0, 216530], [7, 216768], [11, 217028], [17, 217308], [23, 217528], [28, 217808], [34, 218574], [38, 218672], [41, 218912], [47, 219152], [53, 219392], [57, 219592], [62, 219832]]}, {"verse": 32, "start": 220736, "end": 227576, "text": "¶ But of that day and that hour knows no man, no, not the angels which are in heaven, neither the Son, but the Father.", "words": [[2, 220736], [6, 220839], [9, 220959], [14, 221179], [18, 221499], [22, 221719], [27, 221919], [32, 222239], [38, 222539], [41, 222819], [46, 223439], [50, 223999], [54, 224199], [58, 224379], [65, 224779], [71, 225059], [75, 225219], [78, 225339], [86, 225799], [94, 226019], [98, 226219], [103, 226799], [107, 226919], [111, 227099]]}, {"verse": 33, "start": 227926, "end": 232099, "text": "Take heed, watch and pray: for you know not when the time is.", "words": [[0, 227926], [5, 228090], [11, 228670], [17, 228870], [21, 229150], [27, 229828], [31, 229959], [35, 230119], [40, 230379], [44, 230739], [49, 231119], [53, 231239], [58, 231599]]}, {"verse": 34, "start": 232449, "end": 242149, "text": "For the Son of man is as a man taking a far journey, who left his house, and gave authority to his servants, and to every man his work, and commanded the porter to watch.", "words": [[0, 232449], [4, 232537], [8, 232657], [12, 232897], [15, 233017], [19, 233317], [22, 233577], [25, 233717], [27, 233837], [31, 234077], [38, 234397], [40, 234597], [44, 234857], [53, 235637], [57, 235797], [62, 235997], [66, 236197], [73, 236557], [77, 237017], [82, 237197], [92, 237597], [95, 237877], [99, 238057], [109, 238357], [113, 238837], [116, 238977], [122, 239197], [126, 239457], [130, 239657], [136, 240341], [140, 240465], [150, 240905], [154, 241085], [161, 241365], [164, 241585]]}, {"verse": 35, "start": 242499, "end": 251057, "text": "Watch therefore: for you know not when the master of the house comes, at even, or at midnight, or at the crowing of the rooster, or in the morning:", "words": [[0, 242499], [6, 243038], [17, 243747], [21, 243887], [25, 244067], [30, 244287], [34, 244567], [39, 244807], [43, 244927], [50, 245287], [53, 245427], [57, 245547], [63, 245767], [70, 246527], [73, 246727], [79, 247447], [82, 247647], [85, 247767], [95, 248507], [98, 248667], [101, 248787], [105, 248887], [113, 249247], [116, 249367], [120, 249467], [129, 250187], [132, 250367], [135, 250507], [139, 250567]]}, {"verse": 36, "start": 251407, "end": 253609, "text": "Lest coming suddenly he find you sleeping.", "words": [[0, 251480], [5, 251590], [12, 251870], [21, 252390], [24, 252630], [29, 252870], [33, 253010]]}, {"verse": 37, "start": 253959, "end": 256796, "text": "And what I say to you I say to all, Watch.", "words": [[0, 253959], [4, 254056], [9, 254196], [11, 254356], [15, 254576], [18, 254776], [22, 255136], [24, 255256], [28, 255496], [31, 255656], [36, 256236]]}]}